msgid "Commands such as 'bigmount --diagnose' do not diagnose anything and may print permission errors. Update the big-mount package."
msgstr "Naredbe poput 'bigmount --diagnose' ništa ne dijagnosticiraju i mogu ispisati pogreške dopuštenja. Ažurirajte paket big-mount."

